'''Jan-gwa city''' was a [[Gungan]] [[city]] on [[Naboo]] located by a waterfall. [[Cad Bane]] went there to kidnap the [[Force-sensitive]] infant [[Roo-Roo Page]] for [[Darth Sidious]], but was apprehended by [[Anakin Skywalker]] and [[Ahsoka Tano]], who had [[Force vision|foreseen]] his arrival and alerted the family.<ref name="CoF" /> This event gave the city a bit of local notoriety.<ref name="Rise">''[[Rise of the Separatists]]''</ref>

